>
>Just an additional question: What is the idea of having a blessed amulet 
>of life saving rather than a uncursed one? Or is there any use at all of 
>blessing any kind of amulet with holy water?
>
It does not cost anything to ask for a blessed amulet - so why not? The
only advantage I know is that if you meet some curse-casters, they'll have
to do it twice to bring the amulet to a cursed state. A cursed amulet also
works, but you can't take it off in case you need some other one. So I
would always wish for a blessed amulet, but generally I won't waste holy
water to bless one.

